# Altibbi

> Altibbi is the Arab world's first and largest Arabic-language digital health platform, founded in 2008. It pairs AI with a verified physician network to deliver end-to-end primary care: 24/7 text, voice, and video consultations, e-prescriptions, chronic disease management, maternal and child health, and mental health support, alongside the region's largest library of Arabic medical content.

Altibbi serves Arabic speakers across the MENA region and globally, with leading positions in Saudi Arabia, Egypt, the UAE, Kuwait, and Jordan. The platform spans consumer telehealth, AI health tools, and B2B white-label solutions for insurers, pharmacies, employers, and governments. The primary language is Arabic, with English expansion underway.

At a glance:
- Founded: 2008
- Headquarters: Riyadh, Saudi Arabia
- Regional offices: Amman, Dubai, Cairo
- Languages: Arabic (primary), English
- Website: https://altibbi.com
- Focus: AI-powered primary care, Arabic telehealth, maternal health, mental health

