## Core services
- Telehealth consultations by text, voice, and video across all specialties
- Primary care focus: general medicine, family medicine, and emergency care
- Chronic disease management programs
- E-prescriptions and structured follow-ups
- Lab report and medical document analysis
- B2B white-label telehealth for insurers and partners

## Flagship products
- [AskSina](https://asksina.ai): AI medical assistant with Arabic instant answers, lab and report analysis, and direct doctor connection; an English version with personal health record personalization is in development
- Altibbi Mama: Maternal and child health platform with calculators, trackers, and a community
- Mental health support: Sessions with licensed therapists, launched in 2024
- Nutrition and wellness: Food estimator and weight loss programs, launched in 2025

